  "cues": [
    {
      "at": 0.15,
      "end": 3.85,
      "text": "たどり着いたのに、思い出が一つ消えた。",
      "kind": "editorial-summary",
      "file": "voice-01.wav",
      "predictedDuration": 2.6254291198276123,
      "speedScale": 1.06,
      "sha256": "7c5555fcd797a814152e62e367e04fdceb1bbecb1c25c2d77a2e0809a31e30ad"
    },
    {
      "at": 4.2,
      "end": 7.45,
      "text": "自作ゲーム、エンバーウェイク。",
      "kind": "editorial-introduction",
      "file": "voice-02.wav",
      "predictedDuration": 2.2406088320264272,
      "speedScale": 1.06,
      "sha256": "d5dcd1e170ccbd60531c1734a4a7008e5c087db4efab766fa45473cad35fb4e8"
    },
    {
      "at": 7.9,
      "end": 11.35,
      "text": "覚えてる？ あの日の約束。",
      "kind": "recorded-Lumi-dialogue-quotation",
      "file": "voice-03.wav",
      "predictedDuration": 2.104045263562562,
      "speedScale": 1.06,
      "sha256": "2822639082196746a68d38d957156d47d785c053216a93153c99382b7eb9c45c"
    },
    {
      "at": 11.9,
      "end": 15.35,
      "text": "当たり前だろ。絶対迎えに行く。",
      "kind": "recorded-Ash-dialogue-quotation",
      "file": "voice-04.wav",
      "predictedDuration": 2.4014987288893392,
      "speedScale": 1.06,
      "sha256": "625e7469fcb27dc76f5f70b65d80fd9f070cbdbf848fd1ef3a0722e2dbcae5b7"
    },
    {
      "at": 15.8,
      "end": 19.35,
      "text": "公園の灯をつないで、鐘楼への道を開く。",
      "kind": "recorded-objective-paraphrase",
      "file": "voice-05.wav",
      "predictedDuration": 3.0442648154497145,
      "speedScale": 1.06,
      "sha256": "d590b96c4ebc2fd0e02ae48f394ca53147b4f5045e5ec24263a1fdb788c03c57"
    },
    {
      "at": 22.5,
      "end": 26.2,
      "text": "光を集めて、炉に火を灯す。",
      "kind": "actual-interaction-explanation",
      "file": "voice-06.wav",
      "predictedDuration": 2.3015223259183593,
      "speedScale": 1.06,
      "sha256": "538aca261a848c53ece08965814b4fec9326c8d6f503f5647c18e240e8d9c764"
    },
    {
      "at": 29.8,
      "end": 33.6,
      "text": "スイッチで、次の足場が現れる。",
      "kind": "actual-interaction-explanation",
      "file": "voice-07.wav",
      "predictedDuration": 2.50619044968542,
      "speedScale": 1.06,
      "sha256": "ded312961a1c41d4853871e153dd73e27bcfb014e91377f1413c28409d7f3d30"
    },
    {
      "at": 45.2,
      "end": 49.3,
      "text": "三つ目の灯。この先で、何を失うのか。",
      "kind": "editorial-question",
      "file": "voice-08.wav",
      "predictedDuration": 3.432413593901778,
      "speedScale": 1.06,
      "sha256": "d531ebb3db0fe29684b0e7aebdf256dbd9d00fe036cf1463ec0ee195a4e82d72"
    },
    {
      "at": 50.4,
      "end": 54.4,
      "text": "あの公園で、何をしてたんだっけ。",
      "kind": "recorded-Ash-dialogue-quotation",
      "file": "voice-09.wav",
      "predictedDuration": 2.605158332226411,
      "speedScale": 1.06,
      "sha256": "a5f803e0b2034f6326c34f0abb8638adaaf80e614abf8d81cbad2cdf7093109e"
    },
    {
      "at": 55.3,
      "end": 59.1,
      "text": "ルミ。君だけは、忘れない。",
      "kind": "recorded-Ash-dialogue-quotation",
      "file": "voice-10.wav",
      "predictedDuration": 2.4914002318539707,
      "speedScale": 1.06,
      "sha256": "04e45c19fdab3dc29fbec68c99bbc51fbfd584d38259612f2eb44e6b545965d1"
    },
    {
      "at": 63.3,
      "end": 68.5,
      "text": "失った記憶。公園でルミと走り回った午後。",
      "kind": "recorded-journal-quotation",
      "file": "voice-11.wav",
      "predictedDuration": 3.390203847761424,
      "speedScale": 1.06,
      "sha256": "42314f5e0d2bdacf9784f3ade485f42ccf53f9b302d94eef12c628cc8c95f6aa"
    },
    {
      "at": 69.3,
      "end": 74.6,
      "text": "名前は覚えている。でも、あの午後の思い出が消えた。",
      "kind": "editorial-summary",
      "file": "voice-12.wav",
      "predictedDuration": 4.019179844473893,
      "speedScale": 1.06,
      "sha256": "c8e616c602c4a97301773e4aeca95c6960e01b02a2e21ff232ba8b6a93520a9e"
    },
    {
      "at": 75.3,
      "end": 80.8,
      "text": "名前を覚えているうちに、迎えに行けるだろうか。",
      "kind": "editorial-next-question",
      "file": "voice-13.wav",
